# Git workflow

`main` is protected by process: no feature commits on `main`. Work on a branch created from latest `main`.

- **New phase:** `feature/phase-N-<short>` (e.g. `feature/phase-1-identity`). Optional smaller PR: `feature/1.1-flyway`.
- **Commits:** short, descriptive, one concern (prefer one commit per sub-phase). No “WIP” / “misc”.
- **Always** open a pull request into `main` (`gh pr create --base main`). Do not push phase work straight onto `main`.
- Never commit `.env`, secrets, school data, or `target/`.
- Skill: `.cursor/skills/git-workflow/SKILL.md`.
